        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>数学练习题</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n        line-height: 1.8;\n        padding: 40px;\n        max-width: 900px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        color: #222;\n        font-size: 16px;\n    }\n    .handwriting {\n        font-family: \"Kaiti\", \"KaiTi_GB2312\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n        color: #2c2c8b;\n        font-size: 1.15em;\n    }\n    .checkmark {\n        color: #d32f2f;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        font-family: sans-serif;\n    }\n    .indent {\n        padding-left: 2em;\n    }\n    .q1-math {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        align-items: center;\n        margin: 15px 0;\n    }\n    .q2-1-math {\n        margin-left: 3.5em;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n    .q2-1-row2 {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        gap: 15px;\n    }\n    .q2-2-math {\n        margin-left: 3.5em;\n        margin-top: 10px;\n    }\n    .q2-3-math {\n        text-align: center;\n        margin: 15px 0;\n    }\n    .q3-container {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: flex-start;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n        margin-top: 15px;\n        padding-left: 1em;\n    }\n    .q3-list {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 20px;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n        width: 160px;\n        height: 160px;\n        background-color: #2b2b2b;\n        color: #ddd;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        text-align: center;\n        margin-left: 80px;\n        border: 1px solid #111;\n        font-size: 0.9em;\n        padding: 10px;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div>\n    <strong>三. 解决问题。</strong>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 15px;\">\n    1. 小明吃了一个西瓜的 \\(\\frac{2}{8}\\)，小红和小明吃的同样多，两人一共吃了这<br>\n    个西瓜的几分之几？还剩几分之几？\n    <div class=\"q1-math handwriting\">\n        <div>\\(1 - \\frac{2}{8} - \\frac{2}{8} = \\frac{4}{8}\\) <span class=\"checkmark\" style=\"position:relative; top:-5px;\">✔</span></div>\n        <div style=\"position: relative; left: -10px;\">\\(1 - \\frac{4}{8} = \\frac{4}{8}\\) <span class=\"checkmark\" style=\"position:relative; top:-5px;\">✔</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"handwriting\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n        答：两人一共吃了这个西瓜的 \\(\\frac{4}{8}\\)，还剩 \\(\\frac{4}{8}\\)。\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">\n    2. 一个盒子里装有一些玻璃球，其中黄球 2 个，红球 9 个，蓝球<br>\n    8 个。\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">\n        (1) 红球比黄球多占玻璃球总数的几分之几？\n        <div class=\"q2-1-math handwriting\">\n            <div>\\(2 + 9 + 8 = 19 (\\text{个})\\)</div>\n            <div class=\"q2-1-row2\">\n                <span>红：\\(\\frac{9}{19}\\)</span>\n                <span>黄：\\(\\frac{2}{19}\\)</span>\n                <span>\\(\\frac{9}{19} - \\frac{2}{19} = \\frac{7}{19}\\) <span class=\"checkmark\">✔</span></span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"handwriting indent\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n            答：红球比黄球多占玻璃球总数的 \\(\\frac{7}{19}\\)\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">\n        (2) 黄球和蓝球一共占玻璃球总数的几分之几？\n        <div class=\"q2-2-math handwriting\">\n            <div>黄：\\(\\frac{2}{19}\\) 蓝：\\(\\frac{8}{19}\\)</div>\n            <div>\\(\\frac{2}{19} + \\frac{8}{19} = \\frac{10}{19}\\) <span class=\"checkmark\">✔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"handwriting indent\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n            答：黄球和蓝球一共占玻璃球总数的 \\(\\frac{10}{19}\\)。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">\n        (3) 请你再提出一个和分数相关的数学问题，并解答。\n        <div class=\"handwriting\" style=\"margin-left: 2.5em; margin-top: 10px;\">\n            蓝球比红球少占玻璃球总数的几分之几？\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"q2-3-math handwriting\">\n            \\(\\frac{9}{19} - \\frac{8}{19} = \\frac{1}{19}\\) <span class=\"checkmark\">✔</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"handwriting indent\">\n            答：蓝球比红球少占玻璃球总数的 \\(\\frac{1}{19}\\)。\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 30px;\">\n    3.填一填。\n    <div class=\"q3-container\">\n        <div class=\"q3-list\">\n            <div>①占整个图形的 ( <span class=\"handwriting\">\\(\\frac{1}{2}\\)</span> ) <span class=\"checkmark\">✔</span></div>\n            <div>②占整个图形的 ( <span class=\"handwriting\">\\(\\frac{1}{4}\\)</span> ) <span class=\"checkmark\">✔</span></div>\n            <div>③占整个图形的 ( <span class=\"handwriting\">\\(\\frac{1}{8}\\)</span> ) <span class=\"checkmark\">✔</span></div>\n            <div>④占整个图形的 ( <span class=\"handwriting\">\\(\\frac{1}{16}\\)</span> ) <span class=\"checkmark\">✔</span></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">\n            [Diagram: right-aligned dark square divided into geometric fractional sections]\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
